  "summary": "围绕 netdata 核对了 9 份公开资料，整理出 8 条入口与动作。可继续研究的方向包括产品试用、内容营销、开发者生态。",
  "summary_source_ids": [],
  "translations": {
    "# Release notes Netdata v2.12.3 is a patch release to address issues discovered since v2.12.2. This release makes the Agent detect a dead Netdata Cloud connection even while traffic keeps flowing, fixes use-after-free crashes when a stale node is removed while a child or plugin is still using it, stops children configured with `": "释放注释 Netdata v2.12.3是一种补丁释放,用于解决自v2.12.2以来发现的问题. 此发布会让代理检测一个已死亡的 Netdata 云连接, 即使交通不停地流动, 当一个 Stale 节点被移除, 当一个孩子或插件仍在使用时, 修复无使用后崩溃, 停止孩子配置为",
    "## Table of Contents - Summary - Highlights - Digital Experience Monitoring (Preview): Real Users and Synthetic Browser Tests - OpenTelemetry Traces: Service Performance, Service Map and Search - IPMI, Rewritten in Go and Now the Default - New Collectors: NVIDIA Jetson and Cisco Meraki - Windows and FreeBSD: Exchange, MSMQ, DNS ": "目录 - 摘要 - 要点 - 数字经验监测(审查):真实用户和合成浏览器测试 - OpenTelections Tracks: 服务性能,服务地图和搜索 - IPMI,重写于Go和 现在默认 - 新收藏器: NVIDIA Jetson 和 Cisco Meraki - Windows and FreeBSD: 交换,MSMQ, DNS",
    "Netdata Blog: Monitoring & Observability Insights | Netdata": "Netdata Blog: 监控和可观察性 Insights QQ Netdata 网络数据",
    "Netdata Pricing: Free Community Plan, Business From $7/Node": "Netdata Price: 自由社区计划,业务从7美元/节点开始",
    "Netdata v2.12.1 is a patch release to address issues discovered since v2.12.0. This release fixes a startup crash and a timezone detection bug in the Windows Agent, stabilizes the eBPF collector across a wider range of kernels and libbpf versions, reduces the load the Docker collector places on the Docker daemon, and removes unn": "Netdata v2.12.1是一个补丁发布,以解决自v2.12.0以来发现的问题. 此发布会修正 Windows 代理中一个启动崩溃和一个时区检测错误, 稳定 eBPF 收藏器 跨越更广泛的内核和 libbpf 版本, 减少 Docker 收藏器在其中放置的负载Docker 守护进程,并删除 unn",
    "Netdata v2.12.2 is a patch release to address issues discovered since v2.12.1. This release tightens SNMPv3 authentication in the SNMP traps receiver, stops alert evaluation from keeping obsolete charts alive indefinitely, makes Cloud reliably see disconnected children as offline and receive every alert transition, restores the ": "Netdata v2.12.2是解决自v2.12.1以来发现的问题的一种补丁发布. 此发布会收紧SNMPv3在SNMP陷阱接收器中的认证,停止提醒评价,使过时的图表无限期存活,让Cloud可靠地将断开连接的孩子视为离线并接收每个提醒过渡,恢复",
    "Netdata: Real-Time Observability and Infrastructure Monitoring": "净数据:实时可观测性和基础设施监测",
    "Netdata: per-second observability for your team and your AI agents. Metrics, logs and traces, anomaly detection on every metric, and an AI SRE that shows you the root cause. Your data never leaves your infrastructure.": "为团队和 AI 智能体提供秒级可观测能力，涵盖指标、日志、链路和指标异常检测，并通过 AI SRE 辅助定位根因。官网强调数据留在自己的基础设施内。",
    "netdata/netdata README": "净数据/网数据 README"
  },
